# Deployment bundles built from costsignal/ with `npm run build`.
#
# Generated output, not source: reproducible at any time, ~28MB each, and stale
# the moment anything changes. Git keeps every blob forever, so committing these
# would permanently bloat the clone for something nobody should be deploying
# from twice. Rebuild instead - costsignal/docs/deployment.md has the steps.
*-deploy.zip
